#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:397
msgid ""
"When unchecked, staff are assigned automatically for this service menu and "
"customers cannot choose a specific staff member."
msgstr ""
"チェックを外すと、このサービスメニューではスタッフが自動で割り当てられ、予約"
"者は特定のスタッフを選べません。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:404
