"Unchecking this also reveals additional settings, such as minimum "
"participants, private booking, and price categories, when multi-guest "
"booking is enabled."
msgstr ""
"チェックを外すと、複数人一括予約が有効な場合に、最少催行人数・貸切予約・料金"
"区分などの追加設定も表示されます。"

